  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-Sectoral Humanitarian Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An award to provide multi-sectoral assistance to contribute to saving lives and protecting people on the move while driving solutions to response displacement. Activities include integrated water resources management, implementing child protection and disability inclusion tools, delivering conflict sensitivity training to iom staff and partners, and deploying surge support to iom offices.</narrative>
  </description>
